    "test_name": "test_minicpmo_4_5_ready",
    "description": "The sweep is c1/c8/c16 with 10/80/160 seed-tts prompts. The previous H100 baseline was two points (c1/c4, 10/40 prompts) and cannot be indexed against this sweep. No c1/c8/c16 baseline is recorded for this prompt schedule; the empty baseline is intentional until those points are measured. test_minicpmo_4_5.json thresholds are a different prompt count and are not reused here.",
